<!-- pkg-partner/pages/customer-detail/index.wxml · 顾客详情（档案/仅自己可见备注/自然日历史单/解绑） -->
<view class="page-body">
  <switch-bar />
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty-text">加载中…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="card">
    <empty-state text="{{error}}" actionText="重试" bind:action="load" />
  </view>

  <block wx:elif="{{view}}">
    <view class="card head-card">
      <view class="row">
        <avatar-view fileId="{{view.avatarFileId}}" name="{{view.displayName}}" size="{{96}}" />
        <view class="flex-1 head-main">
          <view class="row between">
            <view class="strong">{{view.displayNameText}}</view>
            <view wx:if="{{view.activeOrderCountText}}" class="tag">{{view.activeOrderCountText}}</view>
          </view>
          <view class="muted">{{view.anchorKeyText}}</view>
          <view wx:if="{{view.phoneTailText}}" class="small">{{view.phoneTailText}}</view>
          <view class="row small number-row">
            <text class="number-label">顾客编号</text>
            <id-text kind="CUSTOMER" no="{{view.customerNo}}" />
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="divider"></view>
      <view class="row between small">
        <text>绑定时间 {{view.boundAtText || '—'}}</text>
        <text>{{view.zoneText}} · {{view.buildingText}} · 宿舍 {{view.roomText}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="row between">
        <view class="section-title">备注（仅自己可见）</view>
        <view wx:if="{{!noteEditing && !readonly}}" class="btn btn-ghost mini-btn" bindtap="onEditNote">编辑</view>
      </view>
      <block wx:if="{{noteEditing}}">
        <textarea
          class="note-input"
          maxlength="{{noteMax}}"
          placeholder="写一句只有自己能看到的备注（≤100 字）"
          value="{{noteValue}}"
          bindinput="onNoteInput"
        />
        <view class="row note-actions">
          <view class="btn btn-ghost mini-btn" bindtap="onCancelNote">取消</view>
          <view class="btn btn-primary mini-btn" bindtap="onSaveNote">{{savingNote ? '保存中…' : '保存'}}</view>
        </view>
      </block>
      <view wx:else class="muted">{{view.partnerNote || '还没有备注'}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="row between section-head">
        <view class="section-title">订单</view>
        <view wx:if="{{!readonly}}" class="btn btn-ghost mini-btn" bindtap="goCreateOnBehalf">代客下单</view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{!hasOrders}}" class="empty-text">{{emptyOrdersText}}</view>
      <block wx:for="{{sections}}" wx:key="key" wx:for-item="section">
        <view class="day-head row between">
          <view class="strong">{{section.label}}</view>
          <view class="small">{{section.summaryText}}</view>
        </view>
        <view
          wx:for="{{section.rows}}"
          wx:key="orderNo"
          class="order-line row between"
          data-order-no="{{item.orderNo}}"
          bindtap="onOrderTap"
        >
          <view class="flex-1">
            <view class="strong">{{item.orderNo}}</view>
            <view class="small">{{item.statusText}} · {{item.serviceName}}<text wx:if="{{item.timeText}}"> · {{item.timeText}}</text></view>
          </view>
          <view class="muted">›</view>
        </view>
      </block>
      <view wx:if="{{showMore}}" class="row center more-row">
        <view class="btn btn-ghost mini-btn" bindtap="onLoadMore">{{moreText}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card unbind-card">
      <view class="small">解绑后顾客需重新发起绑定才能继续下单；历史订单与绑定期间的宿舍标识会保留。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{unbind.lockText}}" class="small lock-text">{{unbind.lockText}}</view>
      <button
        class="btn btn-danger btn-block unbind-btn"
        disabled="{{unbinding || unbind.disabled}}"
        bindtap="onUnbindTap"
      >{{unbinding ? '解绑中…' : unbind.buttonText}}</button>
      <view class="small unbind-reason">解绑原因：{{unbind.reasonText}}（会通知顾客）</view>
    </view>

    <view class="footer-id row center">
      <text class="small">服务兼职编号</text>
      <id-text kind="PARTNER" no="{{partnerNo}}" />
      <text class="small">（我）</text>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
